#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:5 1fbafe2f4ee04524960c9275c7936d67
msgid "Tuning the Balance Bot"
msgstr "平衡机器人调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:8 5e37ea61ded147779e9d9f24879dc305
msgid "Tuning Pitch Control"
msgstr "俯仰控制调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:10 e922fb342afd418981c9c7b2a91e031a
msgid ""
"The Pitch controller should be tuned in Manual mode. The parameters "
"involved in tuning this controller are:"
msgstr "俯仰控制器应在 Manual 模式下进行调参。涉及调参的参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:12 0e3ec62fa1d2453c9216a2209bde6b3e
msgid ""
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`: Pitch angle limit.  If the user "
"provides full throttle the vehicle will attempt to lean at this angle"
msgstr ":ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`：俯仰角限制。用户提供满油门时，车辆将尝试以此角度倾斜"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:13 f0f5d99c1baa409881ab28f536a411da
msgid ""
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`: Pitch trim to offset tilt of "
"center of mass"
msgstr ":ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`：俯仰配平，用于补偿重心偏移"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:14 f6014ae055f84a8bb855c6a53a1211ec
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_PIT_FF <ATC_BAL_PIT_FF>`: Feed forward gain using the "
"current pitch angle.  This should normally be set to 0.4"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_PIT_FF <ATC_BAL_PIT_FF>`：基于当前俯仰角的前馈增益。通常应设置为 0.4"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:15 76666ec0eb63426384c0c5a13c62285f
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FF <ATC_BAL_FF>`: Feed forward gain using desired pitch "
"angle.  This should normally be set to 0"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_FF <ATC_BAL_FF>`：基于期望俯仰角的前馈增益。通常应设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:16 391f286b7b584b19b02254837c338f1f
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`: P gain used to correct the current pitch "
"angle error.  Higher values will result in faster error correction but if"
" too high will lead to oscillation."
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`：用于修正当前俯仰角误差的 P 增益。数值越大误差修正越快，但过大会导致震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:17 d301c05f8baf4136949bb05ccfe5c34d
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>`: I gain used to correct long term pitch "
"angle errors.  Setting to the same value as P often works well.  If set "
"too high this could lead to slow oscillations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>`：用于修正长期俯仰角误差的 I 增益。设置为与 P "
"相同的值通常效果良好。设置过高可能导致低频震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:18 fd059f960a7d4395ab0ea2128bf3e1ed
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>`: D gain used to correct changes in pitch "
"angle error.  Setting to higher values may result in a more stable pitch "
"control but if too high can lead to very fast oscillations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>`：用于修正俯仰角误差变化率的 D "
"增益。设置较大值可能使俯仰控制更稳定，但过大会导致高频震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:19 c4fd879af2804718b263ae996d7196d3
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_IMAX <ATC_BAL_IMAX>`: I term maximum value.  This should "
"normally be set to 1"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_IMAX <ATC_BAL_IMAX>`：I 项最大值。通常应设置为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:20 9d4d22963390400a8ec30f585576b787
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTT <ATC_BAL_FLTT>`: Filter applied to the desired pitch "
"angle.  Lower values lead to a slower moving desired pitch angle target."
"  Higher values lead to a more responsive pitch target"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTT "
"<ATC_BAL_FLTT>`：应用于期望俯仰角的滤波器。数值越小，期望俯仰角目标变化越慢；数值越大，俯仰目标响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:21 a87b7115fcf54d8d996e8be84f195a41
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTE <ATC_BAL_FLTE>`: Filter applied to the pitch error.  "
"Lower values lead to a slower response to pitch angle errors.  Higher "
"values lead to a faster response"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTE <ATC_BAL_FLTE>`：应用于俯仰误差的滤波器。数值越小，对俯仰角误差的响应越慢；数值越大，响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:22 dcbae24560e144bdbc986a2ba34a81d2
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTD <ATC_BAL_FLTD>`: Filter applied to the pitch error "
"applied to the D term.  Lower values lead to a slower response to changes"
" in pitch angle errors.  Higher values lead to a faster response"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTD <ATC_BAL_FLTD>`：应用于 D "
"项俯仰误差的滤波器。数值越小，对俯仰角误差变化的响应越慢；数值越大，响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:24 8dfb1f94fef141b1bfa5340f7dd85124
msgid ""
"Good tuning of the pitch controller is crucial for tuning other Control "
"Modes."
msgstr "良好的俯仰控制器调参对于调整其他控制模式至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:27 807fa57f84cb465cb853c8c285decf96
msgid "Real-time Tuning of Pitch Control"
msgstr "俯仰控制实时调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:29 f5019012fd2f4fe6be7b55327614ef99
msgid ""
"It is best to connect the ground station (e.g. Mission Planner) to the "
"vehicle using a telemetry radio and then enable real-time display of the "
"Pitch PID controller's inputs and outputs by doing the following"
msgstr "最好通过数传无线电将地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接到车辆，然后按照以下步骤启用俯仰 PID 控制器输入输出的实时显示"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:31 8dea08e5ae6a49b38af85cfa2a16d4c0
msgid "Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` = 4 (Pitch)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` = 4（俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:32 da3990a7c62347b6b26a411498e97bb9
msgid ""
"Connect with Mission Planner, go to the Data screen and check the "
"\"Tuning\" checkbox in the bottom middle.  From the large \"Display "
"This\" window check \"piddesired\", \"pidachieved\" and optionally "
"\"pidP\", \"pidI\" and \"pidD\""
msgstr ""
"连接 Mission Planner，进入数据界面，勾选底部中央的「Tuning」复选框。在弹出的「Display "
"This」窗口中勾选「piddesired」、「pidachieved」，以及可选的「pidP」、「pidI」和「pidD」"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:33 c2411e5f7c734d10b94f96332c5db521
msgid ""
"Speed up the rate of the PID_TUNING messages using Mission Planner's "
"Ctrl-F Message Interval feature"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的 Ctrl-F 消息间隔功能加快 PID_TUNING 消息的发送频率"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:38 8aee2e8a9ed7479cbcde3c8317046bdd
msgid "Stand the vehicle upright and arm in Manual mode"
msgstr "将车辆竖立并在 Manual 模式下解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:39 9b5490ea639b44aa97ea5a728e952a45
msgid ""
"With the throttle stick in the middle the \"piddesired\" should always be"
" zero while the \"pidachieved\" will move as the vehicle pitches back and"
" forth"
msgstr "油门杆居中时，「piddesired」应始终为零，而「pidachieved」会随车辆前后俯仰而变化"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:40 fa70f9b6b36440d4baf48d419687c33c
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's Config Full Parameter Tree and adjust "
":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`, :ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>` and "
":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>` gains so that \"pidachieved\" follows "
"\"piddesired\" (e.g. stays near zero)"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的配置完整参数树，调整 :ref:`ATC_BAL_P "
"<ATC_BAL_P>`、:ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>` 和 :ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>` "
"增益，使「pidachieved」跟随「piddesired」（例如保持接近零）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:41 b4536fc9fdb848b1a451ea0b34237ec0
msgid ""
"The vehicle may drift off in either direction so be ready to catch it and"
" return it to its original position.  Drifting is not necessarily a "
"problem at this stage, the goal is for \"pidachieved\" to follow "
"\"piddesired\" as closely as possible"
msgstr "车辆可能会向任一方向漂移，请做好准备随时抓住并归位。此阶段漂移不一定是问题，目标是让「pidachieved」尽可能紧密地跟随「piddesired」"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:42 e8025dc836364e81ad83e8bdf8c06501
msgid ""
"Apply throttle stick inputs which should result in \"piddesired\" "
"changing.  Continue to adjust the gains so \"pidachieved\" tracks well"
msgstr "推动油门杆，「piddesired」应随之变化。继续调整增益，使「pidachieved」能够良好跟踪"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:44 03cfab3bf12e44f38b2c0a5e2a4260a0
msgid ""
"A good tuning methodology is to increase P and I in turn: Increase P "
"until the vehicle starts to oscillate, then increase I until the vehicle "
"starts to wobble back and forth. Once this gives a reasonably good "
"response, D can be increased to increase responsiveness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:47 78241d85fb0945b69ef4a5cacfee7845
msgid ""
"Stable PID values for ATC_BAL_* can be quite large, particularly for "
"small vehicles. Good starting values are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:49 6b5ea595258243008b510947403cc1fd
msgid ":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>` = 3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:50 cb73abfd2feb4505a2c1ec7cd46b89e1
msgid ":ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>` = 8"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:51 e9c320f2e13d4933b16bc832b7c85456
msgid ":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>` = 0.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:54 98041a13c2704799ad25255a9a3d5649
msgid "Motor Dead Zone and Expo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:56 9fbe2acfae2f44a6b1b8feeb2445cbd7
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` is recommended to be -0.5, to give a"
" stable pitch angle at both small and large pitch angles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:61 7613dcc031c54a3bb34206272205906f
msgid "Reducing Drift with Pitch Trim"
msgstr "使用俯仰配平减少漂移"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:63 4aab5d5244a64858a7dc9099f030d829
msgid ""
"If the vehicle consistently drifts in one direction while upright in "
"Manual mode the center of mass may be slightly off of center.  "
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` sets the default pitch angle at "
"zero throttle."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆在 Manual 模式下直立时持续向一个方向漂移，重心可能略有偏移。:ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM "
"<BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` 设置零油门时的默认俯仰角。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:65 c2fbc473d1e5464fa4037f47308c33a8
msgid ""
"If the balance bot drifts forward, increase :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM "
"<BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` in steps of 0.1 until the vehicle's drift is reduced.  "
"If the balance bot drifts backwards, decrease :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM "
"<BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`."
msgstr ""
"如果平衡机器人向前漂移，以 0.1 为步长增大 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` "
"直至漂移减小。如果向后漂移，则减小 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:68 06b8f0a51026439bbb949a5100490260
msgid "Pitch Limiting"
msgstr "俯仰限制"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:70 5e21b142b4d04981859bc6967b2cb39c
msgid ""
"Rover-4.3 (and higher) includes automatic pitch limiting to reduce the "
"chance of the vehicle falling over due to throttle saturation.  The "
"feature works by monitoring the throttle output and if it crosses a given"
" threshold the maximum pitch angle is temporarily reduced."
msgstr "Rover-4.3（及更高版本）包含自动俯仰限制功能，以减少因油门饱和导致车辆倾倒的概率。该功能通过监控油门输出实现，当油门超过给定阈值时，最大俯仰角会被临时降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:72 6ccb4dd1000345c58da769dd17c596da
msgid ""
"The parameters below can be used to tune this features although normally "
"they can be left at their default values"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整此功能，通常保持默认值即可"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:74 4ba6c8a43d93434696eb8146807dbfc8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_THR<ATC_BAL_LIM_THR>`: pitch limit feature's throttle "
"threshold (expressed as a value between 0 and 1).  If the vehicle's "
"throttle climbs above this limit the vehicle's maximum pitch angle will "
"be reduced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_THR<ATC_BAL_LIM_THR>`：俯仰限制功能的油门阈值（取值在 0 到 1 "
"之间）。当车辆油门超过此限制时，车辆的最大俯仰角将被降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:75 f0758fd697f140fca02a523943022e92
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_TC<ATC_BAL_LIM_TC>`: pitch limit feature's time "
"constant.  Lower values will cause the pitch limit to be reduced quickly."
"  Higher values will limit the pitch more slowly."
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_TC<ATC_BAL_LIM_TC>`：俯仰限制功能的时间常数。数值越小，俯仰限制降低越快；数值越大，俯仰限制降低越慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:83 b03fcb64af28467c9b7061c0e97e55d0
msgid "Tuning Acro Mode"
msgstr "Acro 模式调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:85 1a49c8017e81460d8c4321aff85d619e
msgid "The following parameters should be set"
msgstr "应设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:87 54319ddd571f48539ffbe4ab7fb008bb
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` = 0 (This parameter can cause "
"conflicts otherwise, in Balance Bots)"
msgstr ":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` = 0（否则此参数可能在平衡机器人上引发冲突）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:88 c0436c251d7c4407be433c05a70eb87e
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`: Maximum speed limit for Speed "
"Controller. To be set by trial and error"
msgstr ":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`：速度控制器的最大速度限制。需通过试验确定"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:90 5334740d2a3644cd8110eaae44d49a73
msgid ""
"With the above parameters set, follow the tuning guides for :ref:`Speed "
"<rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` and :ref:`Steering<rover-tuning-"
"steering-rate>`. Another important thing to note is that the feed-forward"
" term described in these pages does not make any positive contribution in"
" a balance bot and is best, set to zero."
msgstr ""
"设置上述参数后，请按照 :ref:`速度 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` 和 :ref:`转向<rover-"
"tuning-steering-rate>` "
"的调参指南操作。另一个重要注意事项是，这些页面中描述的前馈项在平衡机器人上不会产生正面贡献，最好将其设置为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:93 f8335eedede54f9a887b1160df22bba5
msgid "Guided, Auto, RTL"
msgstr "Guided、Auto、RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:95 675303c880c44e4ba693918281907fba
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`Navigation tuning instructions <rover-tuning-"
"navigation>` to tune the vehicle for autonomous modes including Guided, "
"Auto and RTL."
msgstr "请按照 :ref:`导航调参说明 <rover-tuning-navigation>` 为 Guided、Auto 和 RTL 等自主模式调整车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:97 9a5fb208060e4a129fa16527661ed9b9
msgid ""
"Optionally it may be convenient to automatically change the mode to Acro "
"after an Auto mission is completed by setting"
msgstr "可选地，通过设置以下参数，可在 Auto 任务完成后自动切换到 Acro 模式，这可能比较方便"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:99 f86227764e85445e9ba88d4df127891c
msgid ":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE <MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` = 2 (Acro)"
msgstr ":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE <MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` = 2（Acro）"

